# French strings of the Swag Scope Markdown viewer. A key omitted here keeps its English value.
# The appearances are named after the styles they reproduce, so those names are not translated.

ui_TipWidth  Largeur de lecture
ui_Narrow    Étroite
ui_Medium    Moyenne
ui_Wide      Large
ui_Fluid     Fluide
ui_TipTheme  Apparence du Markdown
ui_ZoomMenu  Options de zoom du Markdown
ui_ThemeApp  Application
